<h1>Your character is ready, <%= @user.name %>!</h1>

<p>
  We generated the character <strong><%= @character.name %></strong> for your
  project <strong><%= @project.name %></strong>. Please review it and approve it
  before you start generating videos.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @review_url %>">Review and approve your character</a>
</p>

<p>Or paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p><%= @review_url %></p>

<p>
  If the character isn't quite right, you can reject it with feedback and
  regenerate a new one — no video can be generated until a character is approved.
</p>
